msgid ""
" A Black Potion of Pure Might is any adventurers dream.  The addition to permanent might can turn ANYONE into a fighting machine.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of four of any red reagent type plus two of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents.  "
